    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Un homme solitaire accueille une baby-sitter dans sa grande bastide du sud de la France. L\u2019enfant n\u2019est pas l\u00e0, il doit arriver demain, apr\u00e8s-demain, bient\u00f4t. La jeune femme a peur de cet homme menteur, charmant, cet ogre qui peu \u00e0 peu l\u2019obs\u00e8de. Il lui parle, l\u2019envo\u00fbte, puis la rejette, se moque d\u2019elle, la ridiculise, pour mieux la fasciner ensuite, comme un serpent avec sa proie.",
        "english": "A solitary man welcomes a babysitter to his large country house in the South of France. The child isn't there, he's due to arrive to the following day, after tomorrow, soon. The young woman is afraid of this charming, lying man, this ogre whom, little by little, she becomes obsessed with. He speaks to her, bewitches her, then rejects her, makes fun of her, to then fascinate her even more, like a snake with its prey."
